适配 NVIDIA 主板


Nvidia上电时序:

Nvidia 主板的上下电时序通过状态机来实现，
主要包括
	PowerOff	关机状态
	PoweringOn	上电过程，提供上电时序
	PowerOn		开机状态
	PoweringOff	下电过程，提供下电时序
	Reset		重启过程，但实际不会更改电源状态
五个状态


状态机运行在 systick 中断，通过 power_handler 被调用。

Nvidia上电时序代码放在 power_control.c 里面，
和 pm.c 中的 Power Manage 任务相互独立。

两个任务通过 pending_power_request 变量来进行交互。







//=======================================================

main function:
	board_init
		SYS_Init
		GPIO_Init
		I2C_Init
	core_init
		InitFlashAndRegist
			/* read register from FLASH to RegistBuffer->flashRegist */
			InitDefaultFlashRegistBuffer
				/* Init all registers in first boot */
			FlashRegistUpdate
				/* Update registers from RAM to FLASH */
		pm_task_init
			pm_gpio_init
			RegistTaskWorker(&PowerManageItem);
				/* PowerManageTaskWorker added to idle loop */
			RegistTransBufferCallback(&PowerManageTransItem);
				/* PowerManageTransCallback added to i2c callback */
			RegistAlarmEventCallback(&WatchdogAlarmItem);
				/* WatchdogAlarmCallback added to timer callback */
		wol_init
			RegistTransBufferCallback(&WolTransItem);
				/* WolTransCallback added to i2c callback */
				/* Set WOL enable or not */
		ir_init
			RegistTransBufferCallback(&IrTransItem);
				/* IrTransCallback added to i2c callback */
			Ir_Timer_Init
			InitIrData
			InitIrUserButton
			/* Enable the interrupt of ir */
		update_task_init
			RegistTaskWorker(&UpdateItem);
				/* UpdateTaskWorker added to idle loop */
			RegistTransBufferCallback(&UpdateTransItem);
				/* UpdateTransCallback added to i2c callback */
	LED_blink
	ScheduleTaskWorkerLooper


idle loop:
	PowerManageTaskWorker
	UpdateTaskWorker


i2c irq:
	PowerManageTransCallback
	WolTransCallback
	IrTransCallback
	UpdateTransCallback


timer irq:
	WatchdogAlarmCallback
	power_handler
		/* handle powering on or off */


gpio irq:

